WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:07.980
The backlog is where wanted work waits before it becomes a card. Nothing here is worked on until you send it to your business analyst.

2
00:00:08.686 --> 00:00:13.282
Open Backlog in the sidebar. Each project keeps its own list.

3
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:20.398
To add an idea, type a title and press Enter. It lands at the top, with normal priority.

4
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.631
Click the star to flag what matters most.

5
00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:27.221
Sort by Newest to see what was added last.

6
00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:36.627
The search box finds an item by its title, its description or a tag, and the filters narrow the list by priority or by who suggested it.

7
00:00:37.327 --> 00:00:44.384
An idea that is no longer wanted can be dropped from its actions menu. You can still find it with the Dropped filter.

8
00:00:45.089 --> 00:00:54.828
To start work, tick the items you want and choose Send to the BA. Owners and Admins can edit the backlog, and everyone on the project can read it.

9
00:00:55.528 --> 00:01:00.240
That is the backlog. Keep ideas here, and send them on when you are ready.
